Subject: Adapt original FontManager callbacks and Wii texture data to native SDK ABI
Upstream-base: bab83befb5d6a2fdff0b30d2ec4b59f7251a108d

Preserve original font requests, registration/fallback/completion decisions and
platform texture algorithms. Adapt real callback pointers and game ownership,
Wii32/16 big-endian texture/directory fields, and canonical native GX/TLUT
object sizes/signatures. No font loader/resource manager replica is introduced.
This bounded compiler/data/SDK milestone does not establish original texture
loading callbacks, GPU upload, font readiness, or Credits drawing.

